        "context_manifest": "/home/puppeteer/MathOCRClaw/benchmark/runs/20260826-145133/workflow/page30/code_outputs/match/question_contexts.json"
      },
      "handwritten_answer": {
        "text": "(3). 设 $M(x_0, y_0), Q(x_1, y_1), (y_1 \\neq \\pm y_0)$.\n$N(x_0, -y_0)$.\n$x_0^2+y_0^2=9, x_1^2+y_1^2=9$.\n$l_{QM}: y-y_1=\\frac{y_0-y_1}{x_0-x_1}(x-x_1)$\n$l_{QN}: y-y_1=\\frac{-y_0-y_1}{x_0-x_1}(x-x_1)$.\n分别令 $y=0$. 则 $x_K=\\frac{x_1 y_0-x_0 y_1}{y_0-y_1}$.\n$x_T=\\frac{x_1 y_0+x_0 y_1}{y_0+y_1}$.\n$\\therefore |OK|\\cdot|OT|=|x_K \\cdot x_T|$\n$=|\\frac{x_1^2 y_0^2-x_0^2 y_1^2}{y_0^2-y_1^2}|$\n$=|\\frac{(9-y_1^2)y_0^2-(9-y_0^2)y_1^2}{y_0^2-y_1^2}|$\n$=9$.",
